Patch: 009-tool-result-barrier-and-refusals
Reason: a call's tool_result entry can be awaited (resultBarrier), and a call the CLI refuses itself (a tool the session does not have) is a tool_refused live event told only once its answer is in the log
Upstream: ours
Pins: a tool the session doesn't have is refused by the CLI, kept in the store, and shown to the host as a failed call by its name; the node still delivers
Pins: a refusal the CLI made reaches the host only once the session's store holds it
